msgctxt "80"
msgid "Mama... I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Date-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I know I'm not Keisuke. And I know I'm not right for you, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I'll... stop going to the bar. I can see that I'm only causing you more "
"pain..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Ehi..."

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"And besides, I'm proud to have been on the force. Might be the only thing "
"Keisuke and me have in common."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Date-san... You don't have to try and be like Keisuke to get closer to me. "
"Or go out of your way to be different than him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Mama..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"All I need is some time... to process everything. And I promise I'll really "
"think about it... About you and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr "*anf* *anf*"

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Heh... You should've seen this coming! But you just had to\r\n"
"play the hero, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Enough... You're here to settle the score with me, right? So leave her out "
"of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"What, you got a thing for her, Date? Hah. I knew it from the\r\n"
"moment you walked into that bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Damn you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"So, you resort to taking hostages and running like a coward?\r\n"
"People like you make me sick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Sorry. But I couldn't just leave you hanging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Still can't do anything by yourself, can you? C'mon Date,\r\n"
"let's dance! The rest of you, take out that fool over\r\n"
"there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "You'll regret this."
msgstr "Te ne pentirai!"

